<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the distance between location lLocationA and location lLocationB Distance is measured through three dimmensional space and not just along the xy plane, so the hieght component of each object's location is relevant.
</p><p><br />
</p>
